OL,3,ANew boss appointed to lead Travelodge
OL,4,
OL,5,FTravelodge has appointed a former Tui
OL,6,Fexecutive to become its new boss from
OL,7,Fthe start of December.
OL,9,FThe former CEO of the Oxfordshire-based
OL,10,Fbudget hotel chain Jo Boydell quit in
OL,11,Fthe summer after safety issues were
OL,12,Fraised at many of its sites.
OL,14,FA woman staying at its Maidenhead hotel
OL,15,Fwas sexually assaulted in December 2022
OL,16,Fafter a man lied to staff to get a key
OL,17,Fcard to her room. Kyran Smith was
OL,18,Fjailed for seven-and-a-half years for
OL,19,Fthe attack.
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
