OL,3,ANew boss appointed to lead Travelodge
OL,4,
OL,5,FPeter Krueger will start his new role
OL,6,Fat Travelodge on Tuesday, replacing
OL,7,Finterim chief Ray Reidy who has led the
OL,8,Fcompany since Boydell quit.
